<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>3.3.6 扩展 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/</link><description>Recent content in 3.3.6 扩展 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 14:19:36 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>3.3.6.1 扩展概述</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/3.3.6.1-Overview/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/3.3.6.1-Overview/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extensions"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extensions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="3361-扩展概述"&gt;3.3.6.1 扩展概述&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　Visual Studio Code 扩展可以为安装添加语言、调试器和工具，以支持你的开发工作流。可以直接从 &lt;a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/vscode"&gt;Visual Studio Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;安装扩展，并享受自动更新，始终使用最新功能。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3.3.6.2 扩展 Marketplace</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/3.3.6.2-ExtensionMarketplace/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/3.3.6.2-ExtensionMarketplace/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extension-marketplace"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extension-marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="3362-扩展-marketplace"&gt;3.3.6.2 扩展 Marketplace&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　扩展为 VS Code 添加语言、调试器和工具，支持开发工作流。本页介绍如何从 &lt;a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/VSCode"&gt;Visual Studio Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;查找、安装和管理扩展。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="browse-for-extensions"&gt;浏览扩展&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　可以在 VS Code 内浏览和安装扩展。选择 &lt;strong&gt;活动栏&lt;/strong&gt; 中的扩展图标，或运行 &lt;strong&gt;View: Extensions&lt;/strong&gt; 命令（&lt;code&gt;Ctrl + Shift + X&lt;/code&gt;）打开扩展视图。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3.3.6.3 扩展运行时安全</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/3.3.6.3-ExtensionRuntimeSecurity/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/editor/3.3-ConfigureTheEditor/3.3.6-Extensions/3.3.6.3-ExtensionRuntimeSecurity/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extension-runtime-security"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extension-runtime-security&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="3363-扩展运行时安全"&gt;3.3.6.3 扩展运行时安全&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　扩展极大地增强了 Visual Studio Code 的功能，但也可能引入风险，例如恶意代码执行和数据隐私问题。&lt;a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/vscode"&gt;Visual Studio Marketplace&lt;/a&gt; 有多种方式保护你免受不良扩展侵害。此外，VS Code 提供多种扩展可靠性指标。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>